":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"temperature"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"top_p","name":"top_p","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"top_p"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"top_k","name":"top_k","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"top_k"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"最小 p","name":"min_p","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"min_p"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"条件","name":"CONDITIONING","type":"CONDITIONING","links":[254,255]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.11.1","Node name for S&R":"TextEncodeAceStepAudio1.5","enableTabs":false,"tabWidth":65,"tabXOffset":10,"hasSecondTab":false,"secondTabText":"Send Back","secondTabOffset":80,"secondTabWidth":65},"widgets_values":["chinese pastoral folk, dusk countryside ambient, guzheng bamboo flute acoustic ballad, mellow healing, 68 BPM, 4/4\nCaption\nSoft chinese pastoral folk ballad at 68 BPM in 4/4 time, core lead instruments include lyrical bamboo flute and warm resonant guzheng with light broken arpeggios, fingerpicked acoustic guitar as harmonic foundation, subtle low cello sustained pads for depth, faint natural ambient samples of crickets, distant bird chirps and soft wind running throughout the track, minimal light wooden clapper percussion only appearing in chorus sections, breathy soft male/female lead vocal with wide warm hall reverb, gentle layered ooh backing harmonies, emotional arc starting with quiet twilight scenery narration, rising warm atmosphere at chorus then calming down in bridge, all instruments gradually thin and fade during outro to restore pure rural dusk tranquility, complete structure: quiet ambient intro → two scenic verses → warm chorus → instrumental flute solo bridge → repeated soft chorus → slow layered fade outro.","[Intro - Slow guzheng single plucks float in first, faint bamboo flute long tone after 4 bars, distant bird ambient wind sound, zero percussion]\n晚风漫过青禾尖\n碎金落日落稻田\n浅溪绕着青石沿\n几尾小鱼藏水面\n蒲公英轻扬飞远\n云被晚霞揉成棉\n[Verse 1 - Gentle fingerpicked acoustic guitar, soft guzheng arpeggios, quiet cricket ambient texture, muted low cello sustain]\n(soft slow breathy vocal, peaceful and tranquil tone)\n老树斜倚田埂边\n等飞鸟倦了归檐\n远处起一缕炊烟\n漫过矮矮竹篱院\n蝉声慢慢弱一点\n黄昏轻拢世间\n[Pre-Chorus - Bamboo flute subtle countermelody rises, tiny wooden clapper light tap rhythm kicks in, light vocal ooh harmonies added]\n(gentle lifted vocal tone, slightly warmer emotion)\n落日吻遍乡间陌\n晚风携来草木香一抹\n远山淡，云色薄\n人间万事皆温和\n[Chorus - Full layered arrangement, bamboo flute main melody, flowing guzheng chord rolls, sustained cello pad, consistent soft wooden clapper percussion, thick airy ooh backing vocals]\n(relaxed flowing vocal delivery, warm soothing timbre)\n炊烟缠上屋檐角\n归鸟落在老树枝头歇\n尘事远，心自阔\n黄昏田园最值得\n[Verse 2 - Thinner texture than chorus, guitar and guzheng lead, flute sparse ornament notes, faint stream flowing ambient sound overlay]\n(soft subdued vocal, slow storytelling tone)\n老牛缓步踏浅滩\n牧童横笛轻声慢\n篱笆开满野菊瓣\n萤火初亮草丛间\n瓦屋飘出饭香淡\n妇人轻唤孩童还\n[Instrumental Interlude - Solo bamboo flute lead melody, guzheng soft chord accompaniment only, all vocal layers muted, natural wind and cricket ambient retained]\n[Chorus - Repeat full arrangement same as previous chorus, balanced guzheng and bamboo flute dual lead lines, full backing harmonies]\n(warm steady vocal, natural relaxed volume)\n炊烟缠上屋檐角\n归鸟落在老树枝头歇\n尘事远，心自阔\n黄昏田园最值得\n[Bridge - Instrument layers thin drastically, only quiet guzheng plucks and faint cello sustain, flute sparse slow long notes, percussion fully removed]\n(whisper soft tender vocal, slight sentimental calm feeling)\n也曾奔赴闹市烟火，追一路车马奔波\n如今偏爱乡间暮色，无需风月多辽阔\n一田晚霞，一溪清波\n便抵世间万千风波\n[Outro - Instruments fade layer by layer: cello fades first, then guitar, guzheng soft residual plucks linger, final slow bamboo flute long tone, only wind and cricket ambient sound remain till complete silence]\n晚霞落，禾风柔\n田园暮，解人愁\n(quiet humming ooh fades out slowly, vocal volume gradually diminish to nothing)",0,"fixed",68,200,"4","zh","E minor",true,2,0.85,0.9,0,0]},{"id":114,"type":"FxAiInputFloat","pos":[-11.6805328